{"version":1,"content":"<p>戴祖儀今日（4日）身穿古裝公主戲服亮相劇集《超時空男臣II》開鏡拜神儀式，她笑言：「過去我成日自稱公主，今次攞正牌做公主啦！</p><p>」近日開工並練出靚腹肌來。</p><p>她指以前拍綜藝都着過古裝，拍劇就第一次，獲知蕭正楠稱讚她有喜感，她亦讚他生鬼，讚賴慰玲是實</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:43.782652+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:58:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.884335+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.884335+00:00","content_hash":"94d4b4e3f97210e55e93ec52c662deea34225208667858f4f3f6aab036cb49ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}